OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a frosty and locally
OL,6,Fmisty start most areas will have a
OL,7,Ffine day with some sunshine. However,
OL,8,Fthere will be more cloud around across
OL,9,Fthe north and far west of the UK with
OL,10,Fpatchy rain, and a brisk breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry night is expected
OL,13,Facross central and eastern parts of
OL,14,FEngland with clear spells and some
OL,15,Ffrost. Cloudier and less cold
OL,16,Felsewhere with a breeze, and some
OL,17,Fshowery rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
