OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FEarly sunshine in the east on
OL,6,FSunday, and later across the far north
OL,7,Fand west. Otherwise cloudy and breezy
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of rain, some heavy.
OL,9,FHill snow in the north.
